#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Start your quantum journey {#start-your-quantum-journey}"
msgstr "Mulakan perjalanan kuantum anda {#start-your-quantum-journey}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Get started {#get-started}"
msgstr "Mulakan {#get-started}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This training is designed for both experts and non-experts who want to learn"
" the basics of quantum computing to accelerate applications in their "
"organization. It provides opportunities to learn about potential industry "
"applications, quantum computing core concepts, and IBM Quantum&reg; products"
" and services.\n"
msgstr ""
"Latihan ini direka untuk pakar dan bukan pakar yang ingin mempelajari asas "
"pengkomputeran kuantum untuk mempercepatkan aplikasi dalam organisasi "
"mereka. Ia menyediakan peluang untuk belajar tentang aplikasi industri yang "
"berpotensi, konsep teras pengkomputeran kuantum, dan produk serta "
"perkhidmatan IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Tips for navigating this course {#tips-for-navigating-this-course}"
msgstr "Petua untuk menavigasi kursus ini {#tips-for-navigating-this-course}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this digital course, you can pace your learning however you prefer. If "
"you need to leave the course, you can easily return later. To view the "
"lessons in each module, click on the module title in the left-hand menu. "
"From there, you can click on a lesson title to view the material. Lessons "
"contain a combination of media. We recommend reading all text, not otherwise"
" marked as optional, and watching all the videos. All links in this course "
"are optional resources and references. \n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam kursus digital ini, anda boleh mengikut pembelajaran mengikut kadar "
"yang anda suka. Jika anda perlu meninggalkan kursus, anda boleh kembali "
"dengan mudah kemudian. Untuk melihat pelajaran dalam setiap modul, klik pada"
" tajuk modul dalam menu kiri. Dari sana, anda boleh klik pada tajuk "
"pelajaran untuk melihat bahan. Pelajaran mengandungi gabungan media. Kami "
"mengesyorkan membaca semua teks, yang tidak ditanda sebagai pilihan, dan "
"menonton semua video. Semua pautan dalam kursus ini adalah sumber dan "
"rujukan pilihan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The total duration is approximately 2–3 hours for reviewing the content "
"directly in this course. However, visiting each link and reference may take "
"additional time, depending on your level of interest in these resources.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jumlah tempoh adalah lebih kurang 2–3 jam untuk mengkaji semula kandungan "
"secara langsung dalam kursus ini. Namun, mengunjungi setiap pautan dan "
"rujukan mungkin memerlukan masa tambahan, bergantung pada tahap minat anda "
"terhadap sumber-sumber ini.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Earning the Quantum Business Foundations badge {#earning-the-quantum-"
"business-foundations-badge}"
msgstr ""
"Mendapatkan lencana Asas Perniagaan Kuantum {#earning-the-quantum-business-"
"foundations-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Upon completion of the course, you can follow the link to IBM Training to "
"take a badging exam if you wish. Upon passing the badging exam you will earn"
" your IBM Quantum Business Foundations badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah menamatkan kursus, anda boleh mengikut pautan ke IBM Training untuk "
"mengambil peperiksaan lencana jika anda mahu. Setelah lulus peperiksaan "
"lencana, anda akan mendapat lencana Asas Perniagaan Kuantum IBM anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![IBM Quantum Business Badge](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-"
"foundations/exam/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Lencana Perniagaan Kuantum IBM](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-"
"foundations/exam/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Course overview {#course-overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan kursus {#course-overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "By the end of this course, you will be able to\n"
msgstr "Menjelang akhir kursus ini, anda akan dapat\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recognize the potential business use cases and impacts of quantum "
"computing\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengenali kes penggunaan perniagaan yang berpotensi dan impak pengkomputeran"
" kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the current state and future of quantum computing\n"
msgstr "Memahami keadaan semasa dan masa depan pengkomputeran kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Evaluate news on quantum computing, including interpreting quantum computing"
" terminology\n"
msgstr ""
"Menilai berita tentang pengkomputeran kuantum, termasuk mentafsir "
"terminologi pengkomputeran kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Find key resources to learn more about quantum computing\n"
msgstr ""
"Mencari sumber utama untuk mengetahui lebih lanjut tentang pengkomputeran "
"kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Identify the steps that you can take to become quantum ready\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengenal pasti langkah yang boleh anda ambil untuk bersedia untuk kuantum\n"
